# #1424 uncaught, module frame, hot: a 6001-iteration module loop (past the
# 5000 OSR threshold) calls the native `dec`, and `/` on line 10 raises on the
# last iteration. Pre-fix: "Error line 7" and "at <module> (line 7)".
# LINE-NUMBER SENSITIVE (the [0g] runner section greps these numbers).
define dec(x) as:
    y is x - 1.0
    return y
k is 6001.0
loop while k > 0.0:
    r is 1.0 / (dec of k)
    k is k - 1.0
